WEBVTT

00:25:59.038 --> 00:26:03.954
A kill signal was a mechanism for
keeping ourselves honest,

00:26:03.996 --> 00:26:07.496
so at the beginning of the project,
we tried to think like,

00:26:07.496 --> 00:26:12.371
what could we see that would tell us, all
right, this just isn't going to work.

00:26:12.663 --> 00:26:17.579
So in our case with popcorn, we really
wanted to make commercial fuel.

00:26:17.579 --> 00:26:21.038
We needed a path to be able to make
it for under five dollars a gallon

00:26:21.288 --> 00:26:24.413
because our thinking was if it's
much higher than that,

00:26:24.413 --> 00:26:26.163
there just won't be a market for it.

00:26:26.663 --> 00:26:29.871
Kill signals are process
boxes to check gates,

00:26:29.871 --> 00:26:32.038
you need to make it through
in order to keep going.